ic Safety Emergency Preparedness Operations Monthly Crime Log Commend Officer Student Break Parking Form Campus Crime Alerts Campus Hazing Act Lost and Found Items Traffic and Parking Regulations Evacuation Maps Career Services For Students For Employers Job Shadow: Employers Job Shadow: Employer Form Job Shadow: Employers FAQ For Alumni Church Relations Conference and Event Services Accommodations Inquiry Form Plan an Event FAQs Counseling Center Disability Services Students Parents Resources Family Engagement First-Generation Students Health Center Human Resources Employee Benefits VU Careers Living Well Community Resource Center Lyceum Theater Box Office Reporting Hotline Title IX Veteran Services Veteran Services How to Apply Military Education FAQ (opens in new window/tab) Veteran Resource Center VA Benefits Active-Duty Benefits Student Veteran Club Reserve Officer Training nav-breadcrumb Home > Resources > Career Services > For Employers > Job Shadow: Employers Job Shadow: Employers This one-day program is an opportunity to mentor Vanguard students, providing them with exposure to job functions within your organization and industry. Learn more about the Job Shadow Program by clicking through the links below! Employer FAQ Employer Submission Form Job Shadow Program Photo Submission Form Student Testimonials “The Job Shadow Program opportunity helped me explore a new career path I could have in the future. It taught me how to manage my time correctly in order to be successful in life.” “I would recommend the Job Shadow Program to other students because it provides insightful information on careers you didn't know were available. It also helps you to connect with someone that may have similar interests and it serves as a guide in terms of making decisions that may shift your desires to pursue a certain career.” “The Job Shadow Program allowed me to explore a career I wasn't even aware existed in the corporate world. It was a great opportunity and experience to learn more.” Questions? Interested in participating? Please contact the Career Services team at careerservices@vanguard.edu or 714-619-6474. For Students For Employers For Alumni Upcoming Events There are no events to display Contact Us Scott Academic Center, 2nd floor Careerservices@vanguard.edu 714.619.6474 footer-container-main Vanguard University A top private Christian university in Orange County, California 55 Fair Drive, Costa Mesa , CA 92626 Map & Directions Contact Us Facebook (opens in new window/tab) Instagram (opens in new window/tab) YouTube (opens in new window/tab) LinkedIn (opens in new window/tab) Schools & Centers College of Arts & Sciences Patty Arvielo School of Business & Management School of Education School of Theology & Ministry Global Center for Women & Justice (opens in new window/tab) Jesse Miranda Center for Hispanic Leadership Judkins Institute for Leadership Studies Lewis Wilson Institute for Pentecostal Studies Resources Job Openings Campus Safety Library Bookstore Registrar Events Press Room News Reporting Legal Notices Text Messaging Terms of Service Title IX Privacy Policy Reporting & Compliance Memberships & Affiliations footer-wrapper utilities Costa Mesa, CA Resources Site Map footer-tracking remarketing <div style=\"display:inline;\"> \n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"border-style:none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"//googleads.g.doubleclick.net/pagead/viewthroughconversion/1033647084/?value=0&amp;guid=ON&amp;script=0\"/> \n</div> footer-tracking sharpspring Powered by Finalsite"
