ergency Preparedness Operations Monthly Crime Log Commend Officer Student Break Parking Form Campus Crime Alerts Campus Hazing Act Lost and Found Items Traffic and Parking Regulations Evacuation Maps Career Services For Students For Employers Job Shadow: Employers Job Shadow: Employer Form Job Shadow: Employers FAQ For Alumni Church Relations Conference and Event Services Accommodations Inquiry Form Plan an Event FAQs Counseling Center Disability Services Students Parents Resources Family Engagement First-Generation Students Health Center Human Resources Employee Benefits VU Careers Living Well Community Resource Center Lyceum Theater Box Office Reporting Hotline Title IX Veteran Services Veteran Services How to Apply Military Education FAQ (opens in new window/tab) Veteran Resource Center VA Benefits Active-Duty Benefits Student Veteran Club Reserve Officer Training nav-breadcrumb Home > Resources > Career Services > For Alumni For Alumni Resources for Alumni We are here to continue to offer support and services to alumni seeking graduate school, significant career transitions or a job change. VUConnect: Explore Jobs Meet with Career Services Recruit Vanguard Students VUConnect: Explore Jobs VUConnect is available to all Vanguard alumni for your continued exploration of internships and jobs. If you no longer have access to the account you created as a student, please contact careerservices@vanguard.edu and we will be happy to assist you regain access with your current email address. Create an alumni account on VUConnect and begin exploring the opportunities available. Meet with Career Services A member of the Career Services staff would be happy to meet with you. Appointments include: Resume/CV Reviews Mock Interviews Salary Negotiation Career Exploration All appointments can be made through VUConnect or by emailing our office at careerservices@vanguard.edu . Recruit Vanguard Students Are you looking to recruit current Vanguard students for open part-time, full-time, or paid internship openings at your place of employment? Please visit our Employer page for more information on attending a fair, tabling on campus, or engaging in other ways. For Students For Employers For Alumni footer-container-main Vanguard University A top private Christian university in Orange County, California 55 Fair Drive, Costa Mesa , CA 92626 Map & Directions Contact Us Facebook (opens in new window/tab) Instagram (opens in new window/tab) YouTube (opens in new window/tab) LinkedIn (opens in new window/tab) Schools & Centers College of Arts & Sciences Patty Arvielo School of Business & Management School of Education School of Theology & Ministry Global Center for Women & Justice (opens in new window/tab) Jesse Miranda Center for Hispanic Leadership Judkins Institute for Leadership Studies Lewis Wilson Institute for Pentecostal Studies Resources Job Openings Campus Safety Library Bookstore Registrar Events Press Room News Reporting Legal Notices Text Messaging Terms of Service Title IX Privacy Policy Reporting & Compliance Memberships & Affiliations footer-wrapper utilities Costa Mesa, CA Resources Site Map footer-tracking remarketing <div style=\"display:inline;\"> \n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"border-style:none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"//googleads.g.doubleclick.net/pagead/viewthroughconversion/1033647084/?value=0&amp;guid=ON&amp;script=0\"/> \n</div> footer-tracking sharpspring Powered by Finalsite"
