ergency Preparedness Operations Monthly Crime Log Commend Officer Student Break Parking Form Campus Crime Alerts Campus Hazing Act Lost and Found Items Traffic and Parking Regulations Evacuation Maps Career Services For Students For Employers Job Shadow: Employers Job Shadow: Employer Form Job Shadow: Employers FAQ For Alumni Church Relations Conference and Event Services Accommodations Inquiry Form Plan an Event FAQs Counseling Center Disability Services Students Parents Resources Family Engagement First-Generation Students Health Center Human Resources Employee Benefits VU Careers Living Well Community Resource Center Lyceum Theater Box Office Reporting Hotline Title IX Veteran Services Veteran Services How to Apply Military Education FAQ (opens in new window/tab) Veteran Resource Center VA Benefits Active-Duty Benefits Student Veteran Club Reserve Officer Training nav-breadcrumb Home > Resources > Human Resources > VU Careers Work at VU We are excited that you are considering applying to Vanguard University. All applicants for adjunct faculty, faculty, and staff positions are required to complete an online application by selecting a position below. Our job board is updated regularly with current openings. For questions regarding faculty positions, please contact the Office of the Provost. For staff inquiries, please contact Human Resources. Thank you for your interest in joining the Vanguard community. Explore Benefits Search for Jobs Search Clear Search Employment Type All 1 Staff 2 Faculty 3 Adjunct Job Type All Academics Admissions Athletics College of Arts and Sciences Financial Aid human resources Information Technology Residence Life School of Business & Management School of Education School of Theology & Ministry Technology Theology and Ministry Network Operations Manager Adjunct Faculty (Pool) - Business and Management Adjunct Faculty (Pool) - English (opens in new window/tab) Adjunct Faculty - Accounting Adjunct Faculty - Biology Adjunct Faculty - Chemistry Adjunct Faculty - Clinical Nursing Instructor Adjunct Faculty - Clinical Psychology Adjunct Faculty - Computer Science Adjunct Faculty - Early Childhood Education (opens in new window/tab) Adjunct Faculty - General Physics Adjunct Faculty - Global Center for Women and Justice (opens in new window/tab) Adjunct Faculty - Graduate Program in Education (opens in new window/tab) Adjunct Faculty - Marketing Adjunct Faculty - Mathematics Adjunct Faculty - Organizational Psychology Adjunct Faculty - Theology Adjunct Faculty - Undergraduate Communication Adjunct Faculty(Pool) - Kinesiology (opens in new window/tab) Adjunct Faculty(Pool) - Music (opens in new window/tab) Load More Equal Opportunity Employer Vanguard University is an equal opportunity employer and prohibits discrimination or harassment of any kind against individuals of race, color, national origin, disability, pregnancy or any other characteristic outlined by federal, state, and local laws. Where permitted by law and in relation to the school's heritage and mission, Vanguard does exercise religious preference throughout the University, and therefore employs individuals who are compatible with the institution, mission and statement of faith. This applies to all employment practices within the university. Vanguard is committed to a hiring process that is based on candidate's qualifications, merit, and operational needs of the university. footer-container-main Vanguard University A top private Christian university in Orange County, California 55 Fair Drive, Costa Mesa , CA 92626 Map & Directions Contact Us Facebook (opens in new window/tab) Instagram (opens in new window/tab) YouTube (opens in new window/tab) LinkedIn (opens in new window/tab) Schools & Centers College of Arts & Sciences Patty Arvielo School of Business & Management School of Education School of Theology & Ministry Global Center for Women & Justice (opens in new window/tab) Jesse Miranda Center for Hispanic Leadership Judkins Institute for Leadership Studies Lewis Wilson Institute for Pentecostal Studies Resources Job Openings Campus Safety Library Bookstore Registrar Events Press Room News Reporting Legal Notices Text Messaging Terms of Service Title IX Privacy Policy Reporting & Compliance Memberships & Affiliations footer-wrapper utilities Costa Mesa, CA Resources Site Map footer-tracking remarketing <div style=\"display:inline;\"> \n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"border-style:none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"//googleads.g.doubleclick.net/pagead/viewthroughconversion/1033647084/?value=0&amp;guid=ON&amp;script=0\"/> \n</div> footer-tracking sharpspring Powered by Finalsite"
